{"parse": {"title": "风暴前夜-08", "pageid": 128099, "text": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><div class=\"tabber no-indent\"><div class=\"episode-inter-nav\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E9%A3%8E%E6%9A%B4%E5%89%8D%E5%A4%9C-07\" title=\"风暴前夜-07\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a><span class=\"nav-page-name\">风暴前夜-08</span><span style=\"display: inline-block; width: 28px;\"></span></div><div class=\"episode-panel\"><div style=\"position: relative; padding-left: 35px;\"><div class=\"episode-deco\"><div class=\"episode-deco-1\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-2\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-3\"></div></div><div class=\"episode-index\"><span class=\"episode-index-chapter\">风暴前夜</span><span class=\"episode-index-number\">08</span></div><h2 style=\"position:absolute; opacity:0; pointer-events:none;width:0; height:0; overflow:hidden;\"><span id=\".E4.B8.80.E6.9D.A1.E5.91.BD.E4.BB.A4\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"一条命令\">一条命令</span></h2><div class=\"episode-title\"> 一条命令</div><div class=\"episode-subtitle\">An Order</div></div><div><div class=\"episode-navbar\"><div class=\"tabber-filter auto-first\" style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; margin: 0 -4px;\"></div></div></div></div><div class=\"episode-switchbtn\"><small style=\"color: #999;\">头像 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small> <small style=\"color: #999;\">背景图 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small></div><div class=\"episode-desc\"><div style=\"display:flex;\"><div style=\"flex-grow:1;\"></div></div></div><div class=\"battle-panel\"><div class=\"story no-indent\"><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-3_3_bg_01.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"3_3_bg_01\"><img alt=\"3_3_bg_01\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/04/Cg-3_3_bg_01.png/600px-Cg-3_3_bg_01.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/04/Cg-3_3_bg_01.png/900px-Cg-3_3_bg_01.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/04/Cg-3_3_bg_01.png/1200px-Cg-3_3_bg_01.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>军帽掉进河里，打碎了一层冰壳。碎冰发出快活的咔嚓声，带着发亮的军徽，高高兴兴地一齐向远方流去。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>将军手里依然握着枪。他的手很稳，脸上却浮现出一丝困惑的神情——他不记得这把枪是什么时候装上瞄准镜的。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>他向瞄准镜中看去。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-3_0_bg_wurenqu2.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"3_0_bg_wurenqu2\"><img alt=\"3_0_bg_wurenqu2\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/ab/Cg-3_0_bg_wurenqu2.png/600px-Cg-3_0_bg_wurenqu2.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/ab/Cg-3_0_bg_wurenqu2.png/900px-Cg-3_0_bg_wurenqu2.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/ab/Cg-3_0_bg_wurenqu2.png/1200px-Cg-3_0_bg_wurenqu2.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">军官：</div><div>冲锋——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">军官：</div><div>骑兵团跟上！不要散掉，从侧翼攻击！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>阿尔蒙塔尔城脚下燃烧着黑色的火焰，神秘术子弹带着不祥的尖啸朝士兵身上扑来。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>进攻的人如同一波浪潮，在弹坑边撞碎了，拍打在铁丝网上，成为无数鲜红的水滴。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>前面的波浪撞碎了，下一波立刻补上，前赴后继，源源不断，如同初春挣脱冰枷锁的顿河水。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"518301.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/HeadIconSmall-518301.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-518301.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"518301.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/HeadIconSmall-518301.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-518301.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/HeadIconSmall-518301.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-518301.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿尔谢尼：</div><div>安德烈！你在干什么？！前进！前进！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"518301.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/HeadIconSmall-518301.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-518301.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"518301.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/HeadIconSmall-518301.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-518301.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/HeadIconSmall-518301.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-518301.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿尔谢尼：</div><div>你会被子弹打死的！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>一颗水滴凝固在山头，没有前进，也没有后退。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>佩伦在如雷的炮声中不安地来回踏步，而他的主人浑然不觉。缰绳摇摇晃晃，在如血的浪潮中颠簸。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>伊戈尔感到自己的食指按在扳机上，那里冷得像一块冰。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"309201.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d4/HeadIconSmall-309201.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-309201.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"309201.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d4/HeadIconSmall-309201.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-309201.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d4/HeadIconSmall-309201.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-309201.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">伊戈尔：</div><div>不要回头。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>一颗炮弹在佩伦脚下炸开，战马发出惊恐的嘶鸣。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>安德烈的喉头动了动，他抬起头，似乎在辨认炮弹来的方向。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"309201.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d4/HeadIconSmall-309201.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-309201.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"309201.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d4/HeadIconSmall-309201.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-309201.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d4/HeadIconSmall-309201.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-309201.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">伊戈尔：</div><div>向前跑，不要回头。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>安德烈双腿夹紧马腹，身体略微前倾，像一张蓄势的弓。没有人知道他此时在想什么。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>但佩伦好像听到了什么，马儿发出一声长长的、喜悦的嘶鸣，向没有敌人，也没有战友的空地跑去。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-3_3_bg_11.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"3_3_bg_11\"><img alt=\"3_3_bg_11\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/48/Cg-3_3_bg_11.png/600px-Cg-3_3_bg_11.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/48/Cg-3_3_bg_11.png/900px-Cg-3_3_bg_11.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/48/Cg-3_3_bg_11.png/1200px-Cg-3_3_bg_11.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"639502.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/17/HeadIconSmall-639502.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-639502.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"639502.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/17/HeadIconSmall-639502.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-639502.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/17/HeadIconSmall-639502.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-639502.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">安德烈：</div><div><i>“没有人能够无缘无故地走向死亡，没有人。”</i></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"639502.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/17/HeadIconSmall-639502.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-639502.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"639502.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/17/HeadIconSmall-639502.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-639502.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/17/HeadIconSmall-639502.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-639502.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">安德烈：</div><div><i>“砰——”</i></div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-3_0_bg_wurenqu2.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"3_0_bg_wurenqu2\"><img alt=\"3_0_bg_wurenqu2\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/ab/Cg-3_0_bg_wurenqu2.png/600px-Cg-3_0_bg_wurenqu2.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/ab/Cg-3_0_bg_wurenqu2.png/900px-Cg-3_0_bg_wurenqu2.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/ab/Cg-3_0_bg_wurenqu2.png/1200px-Cg-3_0_bg_wurenqu2.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>伊戈尔下意识地按下扳机。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>“咔哒。”</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>枪里没有子弹。子弹已经被他打光了，他手里只有马刀，马刀也已经卷刃，上面长满蜷曲的锯齿。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"531601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/38/HeadIconSmall-531601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-531601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"531601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/38/HeadIconSmall-531601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-531601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/38/HeadIconSmall-531601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-531601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">瓦西里：</div><div><i>“近战的时候，马刀比枪更快。”</i></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"309201.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d4/HeadIconSmall-309201.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-309201.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"309201.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d4/HeadIconSmall-309201.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-309201.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d4/HeadIconSmall-309201.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-309201.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">伊戈尔：</div><div>你说得对，父亲。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-3_0_bg_wurenqu1.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"3_0_bg_wurenqu1\"><img alt=\"3_0_bg_wurenqu1\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/52/Cg-3_0_bg_wurenqu1.png/600px-Cg-3_0_bg_wurenqu1.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/52/Cg-3_0_bg_wurenqu1.png/900px-Cg-3_0_bg_wurenqu1.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/52/Cg-3_0_bg_wurenqu1.png/1200px-Cg-3_0_bg_wurenqu1.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>他的脚下是蓝色制服的尸体，蓝色制服下是黄色制服的尸体。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>敌人和战友亲密地额头贴着后背，一层叠一层，堆成一座高高的山坡。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">通讯器：</div><div><i>“嗡——嗡——”</i></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">通讯器：</div><div><i>“伊戈尔上将，您申请的1995年阿尔蒙塔尔战役资料尚未解密。”</i></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"309201.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d4/HeadIconSmall-309201.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-309201.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"309201.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d4/HeadIconSmall-309201.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-309201.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d4/HeadIconSmall-309201.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-309201.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">伊戈尔：</div><div>所以我暂时没有权限查看行动目的。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">通讯器：</div><div><i>“目前您只需要遵循命令。命令就是……”</i></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"309201.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d4/HeadIconSmall-309201.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-309201.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"309201.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d4/HeadIconSmall-309201.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-309201.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d4/HeadIconSmall-309201.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-309201.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">伊戈尔：</div><div>前进，不惜一切代价。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"309201.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d4/HeadIconSmall-309201.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-309201.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"309201.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d4/HeadIconSmall-309201.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-309201.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d4/HeadIconSmall-309201.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-309201.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">伊戈尔：</div><div>但我的士兵不能是那个代价。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"309201.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d4/HeadIconSmall-309201.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-309201.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"309201.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d4/HeadIconSmall-309201.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-309201.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d4/HeadIconSmall-309201.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-309201.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">伊戈尔：</div><div>我请求在和重塑之手的战役中使用真空弹。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">通讯器：</div><div><i>“鸽子屋认为，现在不是使用该武器的正确时机。”</i></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"309201.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d4/HeadIconSmall-309201.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-309201.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"309201.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d4/HeadIconSmall-309201.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-309201.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d4/HeadIconSmall-309201.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-309201.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">伊戈尔：</div><div>那什么时候，才是那个“时机”？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>通讯器里传来长久的，带着重量的沉默。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">通讯器：</div><div><i>“您知道的，命令一直只有一条。”</i></div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-1_9_bg_tiankong_bianyi.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"1_9_bg_tiankong_bianyi\"><img alt=\"1_9_bg_tiankong_bianyi\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d3/Cg-1_9_bg_tiankong_bianyi.png/600px-Cg-1_9_bg_tiankong_bianyi.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d3/Cg-1_9_bg_tiankong_bianyi.png/900px-Cg-1_9_bg_tiankong_bianyi.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d3/Cg-1_9_bg_tiankong_bianyi.png/1200px-Cg-1_9_bg_tiankong_bianyi.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>他看见大地出现一条柔软的褶皱，士兵的尸体像酒杯口的小虫子一样，滑入不见底的深渊。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">通讯器：</div><div><i>“我们对每一位士兵的牺牲致以崇高的敬意。”</i></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">通讯器：</div><div><i>“为了跨越不可知的混沌，我们依然需要您的士兵配合实验……”</i></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>他看见无数士兵向那座白色石屋走去，抛弃了自己的脸，融进一片纯粹的白色里。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>他们没有再回来，回来的只有纪功廊上密密麻麻的名字。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-2_0_bg_jijinhuidanganshi.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"2_0_bg_jijinhuidanganshi\"><img alt=\"2_0_bg_jijinhuidanganshi\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/00/Cg-2_0_bg_jijinhuidanganshi.png/600px-Cg-2_0_bg_jijinhuidanganshi.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/00/Cg-2_0_bg_jijinhuidanganshi.png/900px-Cg-2_0_bg_jijinhuidanganshi.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/00/Cg-2_0_bg_jijinhuidanganshi.png/1200px-Cg-2_0_bg_jijinhuidanganshi.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"517901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/94/HeadIconSmall-517901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-517901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"517901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/94/HeadIconSmall-517901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-517901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/94/HeadIconSmall-517901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-517901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">莫莉德尔：</div><div>这么多人……是为什么战斗，又是为什么牺牲？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"309201.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d4/HeadIconSmall-309201.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-309201.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"309201.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d4/HeadIconSmall-309201.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-309201.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d4/HeadIconSmall-309201.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-309201.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">伊戈尔：</div><div>我不知道，莫莉德尔，我的女儿。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>他在纪功廊上看见自己的照片，定格在他刚进芝诺的那一年。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>拍照的那天，所有人都穿上了最干净的衬衫，节日才会拿出来的裤子。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>他们怀着悲凉而甜蜜的心情，等待着那终会到来的荣耀。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"309201.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d4/HeadIconSmall-309201.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-309201.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"309201.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d4/HeadIconSmall-309201.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-309201.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d4/HeadIconSmall-309201.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-309201.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">伊戈尔：</div><div>我曾经无比坚信着这一切，不曾怀疑。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"309201.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d4/HeadIconSmall-309201.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-309201.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"309201.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d4/HeadIconSmall-309201.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-309201.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d4/HeadIconSmall-309201.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-309201.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">伊戈尔：</div><div>我把你们丢到火线上，我让你们不计代价地前进，不管前面是悬崖还是火海。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"309201.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d4/HeadIconSmall-309201.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-309201.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"309201.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d4/HeadIconSmall-309201.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-309201.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d4/HeadIconSmall-309201.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-309201.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">伊戈尔：</div><div>命令一直只有一条。我曾认为它会为这个世界带来和平与秩序，会为战士带来不灭的荣耀。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"309201.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d4/HeadIconSmall-309201.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-309201.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"309201.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d4/HeadIconSmall-309201.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-309201.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d4/HeadIconSmall-309201.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-309201.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">伊戈尔：</div><div>但是，但是……</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-3_3_at_32.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"3_3_at_32\"><img alt=\"3_3_at_32\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2f/Cg-3_3_at_32.png/600px-Cg-3_3_at_32.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2f/Cg-3_3_at_32.png/900px-Cg-3_3_at_32.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2f/Cg-3_3_at_32.png/1200px-Cg-3_3_at_32.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>伊戈尔感到手心尖锐的触感，他打开手，那里躺着一枚骰子。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>“他的心是只悬挂的琴，悬挂的琴……轻轻一拨……”</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>他感到一下空空的震动。是的，这样的事情以前发生过很多次，以后也会发生。而他的心曾经坚如磐石。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>命运轻轻拨动了早就锈蚀的琴弦。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>骰子和圣保罗的雨一起落了下来。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-3_3_at_33.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"3_3_at_33\"><img alt=\"3_3_at_33\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/76/Cg-3_3_at_33.png/600px-Cg-3_3_at_33.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/76/Cg-3_3_at_33.png/900px-Cg-3_3_at_33.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/76/Cg-3_3_at_33.png/1200px-Cg-3_3_at_33.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"309201.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d4/HeadIconSmall-309201.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-309201.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"309201.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d4/HeadIconSmall-309201.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-309201.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d4/HeadIconSmall-309201.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-309201.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">伊戈尔：</div><div>这份荣耀背叛了我们，于是我选择背叛它。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"309201.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d4/HeadIconSmall-309201.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-309201.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"309201.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d4/HeadIconSmall-309201.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-309201.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d4/HeadIconSmall-309201.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-309201.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">伊戈尔：</div><div>请原谅我，孩子们。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"309201.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d4/HeadIconSmall-309201.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-309201.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"309201.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d4/HeadIconSmall-309201.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-309201.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d4/HeadIconSmall-309201.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-309201.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">伊戈尔：</div><div>我的罪不是因为玷污了这份荣耀，不是因为违反那座白色石屋的命令。而是因为，我没有始终和你们站在一起。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"309201.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d4/HeadIconSmall-309201.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-309201.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"309201.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d4/HeadIconSmall-309201.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-309201.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d4/HeadIconSmall-309201.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-309201.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">伊戈尔：</div><div>我没有为每一个人带来明天。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"531601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/38/HeadIconSmall-531601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-531601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"531601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/38/HeadIconSmall-531601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-531601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/38/HeadIconSmall-531601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-531601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">瓦西里：</div><div>哈哈，哈哈哈哈哈……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"531601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/38/HeadIconSmall-531601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-531601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"531601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/38/HeadIconSmall-531601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-531601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/38/HeadIconSmall-531601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-531601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">瓦西里：</div><div>多么勇敢，但是个不折不扣的蠢货。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-senlin_ye.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"senlin_ye\"><img alt=\"senlin_ye\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/22/Cg-senlin_ye.png/600px-Cg-senlin_ye.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/22/Cg-senlin_ye.png/900px-Cg-senlin_ye.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/22/Cg-senlin_ye.png/1200px-Cg-senlin_ye.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>苍老的、醉醺醺的骑兵团长，站在满地的落叶上，他的眼睛里闪着火一样的光。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"531601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/38/HeadIconSmall-531601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-531601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"531601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/38/HeadIconSmall-531601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-531601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/38/HeadIconSmall-531601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-531601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">瓦西里：</div><div>年轻人，让醉鬼传授你一个胜利的诀窍吧。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"531601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/38/HeadIconSmall-531601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-531601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"531601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/38/HeadIconSmall-531601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-531601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/38/HeadIconSmall-531601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-531601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">瓦西里：</div><div>你要畏惧死亡，孩子。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"531601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/38/HeadIconSmall-531601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-531601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"531601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/38/HeadIconSmall-531601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-531601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/38/HeadIconSmall-531601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-531601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">瓦西里：</div><div>不仅畏惧自己的死亡，你要畏惧每一个人的死亡。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"309201.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d4/HeadIconSmall-309201.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-309201.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"309201.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d4/HeadIconSmall-309201.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-309201.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d4/HeadIconSmall-309201.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-309201.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">伊戈尔：</div><div>他们的死亡就在我的肩膀上。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"309201.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d4/HeadIconSmall-309201.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-309201.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"309201.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d4/HeadIconSmall-309201.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-309201.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d4/HeadIconSmall-309201.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-309201.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">伊戈尔：</div><div>我会一直和战士们站在一起，不管是生者，还是死者。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"309201.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d4/HeadIconSmall-309201.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-309201.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"309201.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d4/HeadIconSmall-309201.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-309201.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d4/HeadIconSmall-309201.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-309201.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">伊戈尔：</div><div>我会一直和我的罪孽站在一起，直到冥界的黑暗将我彻底吞噬。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>老兵不置可否地笑了笑，他把干枯的手伸进军衣兜里，却没有掏到酒瓶。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"531601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/38/HeadIconSmall-531601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-531601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"531601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/38/HeadIconSmall-531601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-531601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/38/HeadIconSmall-531601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-531601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">瓦西里：</div><div>啧，小伊戈尔，还记得怎么用枪吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"309201.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d4/HeadIconSmall-309201.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-309201.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"309201.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d4/HeadIconSmall-309201.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-309201.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d4/HeadIconSmall-309201.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-309201.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">伊戈尔：</div><div>记得，父亲。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"309201.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d4/HeadIconSmall-309201.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-309201.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"309201.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d4/HeadIconSmall-309201.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-309201.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d4/HeadIconSmall-309201.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-309201.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">伊戈尔：</div><div>先把枪托紧紧地抵在肩上，身体微微向后。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>伊戈尔把右手食指放在扳机上，他看见雪花落在枪管，扳机冷得像一块冰。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"309201.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d4/HeadIconSmall-309201.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-309201.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"309201.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d4/HeadIconSmall-309201.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-309201.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d4/HeadIconSmall-309201.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-309201.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">伊戈尔：</div><div>保持身体稳定。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"309201.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d4/HeadIconSmall-309201.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-309201.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"309201.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d4/HeadIconSmall-309201.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-309201.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d4/HeadIconSmall-309201.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-309201.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">伊戈尔：</div><div>慢慢地……</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-3_3_at_03_zone.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"3_3_at_03_zone\"><img alt=\"3_3_at_03_zone\" src=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/e/e0/Cg-3_3_at_03_zone.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"348\" class=\"story-bg\" data-file-width=\"428\" data-file-height=\"248\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">伊戈尔：</div><div>均匀地……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">伊戈尔：</div><div>吸气，呼气，这口气的尽头，就是“时机”。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>他闭上眼，再睁开眼，瞄准镜里出现一个人影。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">伊戈尔：</div><div>不要回头，同志。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">伊戈尔：</div><div>向前跑，不要回头。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>人影越来越清晰，停在了草原和雪地的交界，没有前进，也没有后退。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>他看了很久，才看清了眼前的人。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">伊戈尔：</div><div>你不能回头，你只能前进，战士。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"309201.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d4/HeadIconSmall-309201.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-309201.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"309201.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d4/HeadIconSmall-309201.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-309201.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d4/HeadIconSmall-309201.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-309201.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">伊戈尔：</div><div>我不会回头，也不会遵循任何人的命令前进。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">伊戈尔：</div><div>你背叛了曾经相信你的人，你背叛了你自己。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"309201.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d4/HeadIconSmall-309201.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-309201.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"309201.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d4/HeadIconSmall-309201.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-309201.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d4/HeadIconSmall-309201.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-309201.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">伊戈尔：</div><div>我已经走上另一条路。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">伊戈尔：</div><div>那是一条正确的新路，还是重蹈覆辙？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>士兵和将军一起站在风雪里，他们思考了很久。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>命令一直只有一条。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">伊戈尔：</div><div>是的，长官。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">伊戈尔：</div><div>服从。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"532002.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c2/HeadIconSmall-532002.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-532002.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"532002.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c2/HeadIconSmall-532002.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-532002.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c2/HeadIconSmall-532002.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-532002.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">伊戈尔：</div><div>坚定。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"309201.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d4/HeadIconSmall-309201.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-309201.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"309201.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d4/HeadIconSmall-309201.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-309201.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d4/HeadIconSmall-309201.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-309201.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">伊戈尔：</div><div>从不退怯。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>他的手指一直按在扳机上。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>砰——</div></div></div></div></div></div>", "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "没有战斗的章节", "hidden": true}, {"sortkey": "", "category": "章节"}], "displaytitle": "风暴前夜-08"}}